## Context

- crc-liquid-biopsy-panel: Completed integrated assessment after developer delivered all three requested corrections.
- Project was missing from active db.sqlite (only in archive). Re-registered at 'analysis' status.
- **Methylation corrected**: AUC 0.979→0.882 (proper LOO-CV, feature selection inside folds, n=24). Bootstrap CI [0.721, 1.0]. MODERATE overfitting confirmed.
- **Protein improved**: AUC 0.871→0.896 (LR alone beats ensemble), sens@95spec 47.7%→57.7% (nested CV, n=121). Best validated result.
