- **LASSO cost fix**: At corrected $5/CpG, methylation dominates. 12-CpG panel $60. All show AUC 1.0 = training performance.
- **CpG-gene mapping**: 7/21 cMCD genes (SFRP1, SEPT9, EYA4, SFRP2, TWIST1, ZNF304, TFPI2). Missing BMP3, NDRG4 (Cologuard targets).
